# Line endings, normalised across platforms.
#
# Without this file `core.autocrlf=true` hands Windows a CRLF checkout while CI
# gets LF, and this repository ended up mixing both styles — `src/index.ts` was
# LF while `src/client/index.ts` was CRLF. That mismatch is what made
# `lib/client.js.map` unreproducible (see `normalizeSourceMap` in build.mjs).
#
# `eol=lf` normalises to LF in the repository *and* in the working tree, so a
# build here produces the same bytes as a build on the CI runner.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never normalise, diff, or merge these.
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
